eir tracts here under fake names. More than a decade ago, Saddam fell, and people were more free to express themselves. They gathered in Mutanabbi to express their ideas, which sparked many protests against his government that rose and fell over the years. Seven years ago her husband was killed in a bombing. Then, before she left to continue shopping for books, Nadawi recited an Arabic saying "Movement, she said, is good." 
