ucial. Yes, bands can make money (sometimes), but it also gives fans a chance to make a human connection with the artists they love. Swift has proved herself an expert at forging those connections. And with her latest trick of pulling her music off Spotify, she strengthens her bond with her followers by making them have to buy her album to prove how much they love her.
